    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 1, 3, 12, 47, 48, 50, 54, 81, 82, 83, 84, 95, 101, 104, 126 and 127 of Block 01, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 410035, situated in the Village of Nayna-madama East within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 485 A - Hanathotupala in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Wennap-puwa, in the District of Puttalam, in the Province of North Western, referred to in Notice No. 41/0204 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2099/09 of 27th November, 2018 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. K.A.K. RANJITH DHARMAPALA, Commissioner of Title Settlement. (Actg.) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 13th May, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0002 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2130/34 - 2019 \u0012\u0013 04 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0016 \u0017\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u0002 \u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.07.04\n\nNo. 2130/34\u2013 THURSDAY, JULY 04, 2019\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 30447 - 14 (2019/07)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0002 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\