    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'08PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 08.07.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2131$06 \u2013 2019 cQ,s 08 jeks i\u00f7od \u2013 2019'07'08\n\nNo. 2131$06 \u2013 MONDAY, JULY 08, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do here by declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.\n\nAn allotment of land in total extent of about 0.8470 Hectare depictedin Advance Tracing No. KA/WLL/17/839 of dated 22.01.2018perpared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Hewessain Maha paththu south Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Walallavita in Kaluthara District in Western Provinceand bounded as follows.\n\nNorth: Weerakandamukalana claimed by Namunukula PlantationCompany and Road (Pradesheya Sabha); East: Weerakandamukalanaclaimed by Namunukula Plantation Company and Road (PradesheyaSabha); South: Road (Pradesheya Sabha) and Weerakandamukalana\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 30469 \u2013 44 (07/2019)\n\nclaimed by Namunukula Plantation Company; West:Weerakandamukalana claimed by Namunukula Plantation Company.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy. No. : 4-3/15/2017/VE/290.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\"Mihikatha Medura\", Land Secretariat,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.2nd October 2018.\n\n07 \u2013752\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5"
