    "chunk_text": "My. No. : 4-3/15/2017/VE/290.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\"Mihikatha Medura\", Land Secretariat,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.2nd October 2018.\n\n07 \u2013752\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\n2AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'08PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 08.07.2019\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nLand Acquisition Act, (chapter 460), as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the land describedbelow is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotments of lands in total extent of 4.103 Hectares depicted inAdvance Tracing No. GA/AKM/06/178 dated 16.02.2006 as Lots Aand B, perpared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village ofAnkokkawala, in the Grama Niladhari Division of 110, Ankokkawalain the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Akmeemana, in the Districtof Galle, Southern Province. The boundaries of the allotments ofland are as follows.\n\n01. Lot A \u2013 Peellagawa Idama \u2013 Extent: 1.220 HectaresNorth and East: Road; South: Lot B of the same advance tracing(river reservation); West: Lot B of the same advance tracing (riverreservation) and Road.\n\n02. Lot B \u2013 Peellagawa Idama \u2013 Extent: 2.883 HectaresNorth: Road, Lot A of the same advance tracing and Road; East:Lot A of the same advance tracing and Road; South and West: Roadand Lake.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy. No. : 4-3/15/2011/VET/207.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,1200/6, \"Mihikatha Medura\",Rajamalwatta Lane,Battaramulla.11th April 2019.\n\n07 \u2013753\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5"
