    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'04'30PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 30.04.2019\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2131$26 \u2013 2019 cQ,s 10 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'07'10No. 2131/26 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 10, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G30487 \u2013 36 (2019/07)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/6/2018/HW/21.\n\nI , Gayantha Karunatilleke Minister of Lands & ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe alloments of below mentioned lands, depicted in AdvanceTracing No. H/BLA/RDA/2018/263 and dated 2018.06.26, preparedby the Survey General, Situated in the village of Mahaheella (F. V.P. 297) in the Minor Division of Giruwapattuwa South in theDivisional Secretary Division of Beliatta in Hambantota District inSouthern Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot 'A' - Dangahahena - Extent: 0.0238 HectareNorth: Lot B; East: Lot B and Lot No. 632, 634 and 576; South:Lot No. 632, 634, 576 and Dangahahena claimed by H. K. Rathnayaka;West: Dangahahena claimed by H. K. Rathnayaka.\n\n02. Lot 'B' - Extent: 0.0224 HectareNorth: Road and Lot C; East: Lot C and Lot No. 578, 577 and632; South: Lot No. 578, 577, 632 and Lot A in same Tracing; West:Lot A.\n\n03. Lot 'C' - Udahawatta - Extent: 0.0341 HectareNorth: Udahawatta claimed by S. C. S. Weerasoori; East:Udahawatta claimed by S. C. S. Weerasoori, Lot No. 580 and 578;\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nSouth: Lot No. 580, 578, 577 and Lot B in same Tracing; West: LotB and Road."
