    "chunk_text": "wxl 2131$27 - 2019 cQ,s ui 10 jeks nodod - 2019'07'10\n\nNo. 2131/27 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 10, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 30488 - 17 (07/2019)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS\n\nAMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION\n\n(AMENDEMENT) ACT , No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. : GAL/LAN/AQUIS/A13/49.\n\nLand Ministry Ref. : 4-3/15/2018/VE/09.\n\nI, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act as Amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment Act), No. 28 of 1964 that theGovernment intends to acquire the lands/servitude describedin the schedule given below for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land/servitude to be Acquired:\n\nAllotment of land in extent about 1.6942 Hectares (4 Acresand 29.8 Perches) depicted in Preliminary Plan No. Preliminary\n\nPlan Ke/3681 dated 10.04.2019 prepared by Surveyor Generalsituated in the villages of Arandara in 64A, Arandara GramaNiladhari Division subdivision of Kandupita Pattuwa Southminor in the Divisional Secretary's Division in Galigamuwa inthe District of Kegalle in Sabaragamuva Province.\n\nLot No. 01 \u2013 Name of the land: Milands Watta; Names of theClaimants: 1. Managing Director, Kegalle Plantations,No. 310, High Level Road, Nawinna, Maharagama,2. Chairman, Land Reformation Commission, No. 82C, HectorKobbekaduwa Mawattha, Colombo 07; Extent about : 1.6942Hectares.\n\nNorth: Road; East: Road and Lot No. 2; South: Lot No. 2,Atala Watta, Batupitiya Division and Koswatta Kumbura;West: Koswatta Kumbura and Road.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid lands to be acquiresare hereby required to appear Personally or by agents dulyauthorized in written before me at Divisional Secretariat,"
