    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2131/54 - 2019 \u0151\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 12 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.07.12\n\nNo. 2131/54 \u2013 FRIDAY JULY, 12, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nThe Code of Regulations on Co-operative Elections (Amendment) formulated on procedures in electing Committee Members of Regions at Multipurpose Co-operative Societies in North-Western Province and matters\n\nconnected or consequential thereto where authority has been vested in the Commissioner of Co-operative Development and the Registrar of Co-operative Societies to formulate regulations for the purpose of electing\n\nRegional Committees in terms of Registered By-laws. BY virtue of powers vested in me through the by-law 23 of the registered by-laws of the Multipurpose Co-operative Societies in North-Western Province or any other specific by-law or/and the by-law No. 24 of the by-law of the Udubaddawa Multipurpose Co-operative Society Ltd and by section 50.2 of the Code of Regulations for electing Committee Members of Regions at Multipurpose Co-operative Societies in North-Western Province enacted by the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No.1981/2 and dated 2016.08.22 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka I, Dissanayake Mudiyanselage Kulamina Chandana Dissanayake, the Commissioner of Co-operative Development and Registrar of North-Western Province, do hereby amend and stipulate the following regulations of the Code of Regulations enacted by me under mentioned for the purpose of electing Regional Committee Members of the Multipurpose Co-operative Societies in North-Western Province.\n\nD.M.K.C. DISSANAYAKE, Commissioner of Co-operative Development & Registrar Co-operative Societies (North-Western)\n\nKurunegala, On 11th July, 2019.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) - PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nNORTH WESTERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL"
