    "chunk_text": "2.2 section 5.2 (c) of the Code of Electoral Regulations is hereby amended by the addition therefor of the following paragraph.\n\n(c) Publishing advertisement in a Sinhala National Daily Newspaper and a Tamil National Daily Newspaper in Sinhala and Tamil medium respectively.\n\nAmendment of section 14.2 of the Code of Regulations\n\nAmendment of sections15.1, 15.2 and 15.4 of the Code of Regulations\n\n4.1 section 15.1 of the Code of Electoral Regulations is hereby amended by the addition therefor of the following paragraph. The name of a candidate to be elected for a Regional Committee should have been proposed by a member of the Society of the respective Region and seconded by another member of the same Region and the nomination paper should be submitted in a form which conforms in every respect to the form appearing in the electoral regulation 15.4.\n\n4.2 section 15.2of the Code of Electoral Regulations is hereby amended as follows. The Candidate, Proposer as well as the Seconder should be persons whose names appear in the electoral register of the relevant Region referred to at the electoral regulation 8.2\n\n3A IV(A) \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.07.12 PART IV(A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.07.2019\n\n4.3 section 15.4 of the Code of Electoral Regulations is hereby amended by the addition therefor of the following paragraph. The nomination paper should be prepared in 02 copies. Such nomination paper should conform to the form \u201ca\u201d of the Schedule four of this Code of Electoral Regulations and should have been duly completed and placed signature."
