    "chunk_text": "wxl 2131$62 - 2019 cQ,s ui 13 jeks fikiqrdod - 2019'07'13No. 2131/62 \u2013 SATURDAY, JULY 13, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n1A- G 30519 -17 (2019/07)\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)AS AMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION(AMENDEMENT) ACT, No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: GAL/LAN/AQUIS/A13/26.Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/15/2013/VE/652.\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude described in theschedule given below for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the lands/servitude to be Acquired:\n\nAllotments of land from 1-8 in extent about 5.6720 Hectaresdepicted in Preliminary Plan No. Preliminary Plan Ke/3684 dated30.05.2019 prepared by Surveyor General situated in theVillages of Boyagoda in 65B Boyagoda Grama NiladhariDivision, Sub division of Kandupita Pattuwa South MinorDivision in the Divisional Secretary's Division in Galigamuwain the District of Kegalle in Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\nLot No. 01 - Name of the land: Dikhena; Extent: 1.2788Hectares.\n\nNorth: Dikhena Watta, Jambugahamulahena Watta andGalaudahena Watta; East: Lot No. 2; South: Lot No. 2 andDikhena Watta; West: Dikhena Watta.\n\nLot No. 02 - Name of the land: -; Extent: 0.3917 Hectare.\n\nNorth: Lot No. 01 and Galaudahena Watta; East: LotNos. 05, 06, 07 and Dikhena Watta; South: Road, Lot Nos. 04,03 and and Dikhena Watta; West: Road, Dikhena Watta andLot No. 04.\n\nLot No. 03 - Name of the land: Dikhena; Extent: 0.5219Hectare.\n\nNorth: Lot No. 02; East: Lot No. 02 and Dikhena Watta;South: Dikhena Watta; West: Dikhena Watta and Lot No. 02."
