    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'15PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 15.07.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2132$2 - 2019 cQ,s ui 15 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'07'15No. 2132/2 - MONDAY JULY 15, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4597\u2014 20 (07/2019)\n\nSOUTHERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nOrders under the Agriculture Statutes No. 03 of 2019 under the Southern Provincial Council\n\nI, Udalamaththa Gamage Dayawansha Ariyathilaka, Minister of Agriculture, Agrarian Development, Irrigation, WaterSupplying and Drainage, Food Supplying & Distribution and Trade & Cooperative Development of Southern ProvincialCouncil hereby impose the following Orders in terms of the Section 17 under the Agriculture Societies Statutes No. 03of 2019 under the Southern Provincial Council. These Orders shall be effective on the day published in the Gazette.\n\nUDALAMATHTHA GAMAGE DAYAWANSHA ARIYATHILAKA,Minister of Agriculture, Agrarian Development, Irrigation,Water Supplying and Drainage, Food Supplying & Distribution andTrade & Cooperative Development of Southern Provincial Council.\n\n4th Floor, Dakshinapaya, Labuduwa, Galle,At the Minister\u2019s Office, Ministry of Agriculture,Southern Province,09th April, 2019.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'15PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 15.07.20192A\n\nRULES AND REGULATIONS OF THE SOUTHERN PROVINCE AGRICULTURAL PRECEPT\n\nDirectives\n\nREGISTRATION OF VOLUNTARY AGRICULTURAL DEVELOPMENT ORGANIZATION UNDER THE SOUTHERN PROVINCIAL DEPARTMENT\n\nOF AGRICULTURE\n\nConditions :\u2013"
