    "chunk_text": "8. An organic fertilizer manufacturer who manufacturers fertilizer as above will be entitled to sell his fertilizer atthe Ruhunu Rasara Trade Organization after having obtained the necessary registration.\n\nRegistration :\n\nb. The manufacturer should agree to pay the registration fee at the time of registration.\n\nc. The manufacturer should be in agreement with the full registration process of organic fertilizer manufacturersof the Department of Agriculture of the Southern Provincial Council.\n\nd. The Southern Province Department of Agriculture will issue a registration number at the point of registration toevery manufacturer and that number, thereafter, should be mentioned by every manufacturer in theircorrespondence with the department.\n\ne. The registration, so obtained, is valid only for one calendar year and at the end of that year the registration hasto be renewed by paying the required fee.\n\nf. The year, as described above, should mean an year commencing on the 1st January to the 31st of Decemberevery year. In each year the registration of organic fertilizer manufacturers or the renewal of their agreementwill take place betweeen the 1st January to 31st March of the relevant year.\n\ng. A manufacturer seeking a new registration should have been engaged in the manufaturing process for a period ofat least 6 months and accordingly, he should be prepared to provide proof of such engagement when required.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'15PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 15.07.20198A\n\nDEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE SOUTHERN PROVINCE\n\nApplication form the for the Registration of Organic Fertilizer Manufacturers\n\nPersonal Details :-\n\n1. Name :\n\n2. Age :\n\n3. Address :\n\n4. E-mail Address\n\n5. Gender :\n\n6. Bank Bank Branch Account Number\n\n7. Telephone Numbers : Home Mobile\n\nLocation :-\n\n8. Di