    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2133/3 - 2019 \u0da2\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8i 22 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 i\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.07.22 No. 2133/3 \u2013 MONDAY, JULY 22, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE ACT ON ACQUISITION OF LAND (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference Number : HANGU/3/2/1/108. Reference Number of the Land and Parliamentary Reforms : 4-3/9/2013/WS/479.\n\nI, hereby inform that the Government intends to acquire the dependence of the following land for the purpose of building the Brake Pressure Tank No. 1A of the Rikillagaskada Water Supply Scheme of the Rikillagaskada Water Supply Project in the Nuwaraeliya District Cluster Water Supply Project, under Sub Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act. Description of the land dependence to be acquired : Lot No. 01 Lot Number 01 of Plan No: N 3291 of Surveyor General. Name of the Land: Rahathungoda Watta (Rutland Division); Description: Open barren land. There is a brake pressure\n\ntank; Claimant: Janatha Estate Developments Board, No. 55/75, Vauxhall Lane, Colombo 2; Extent: 0.0173 Hectare. All those who make claims or other connections to the above-named land, must be present before me by themselves or by the persons who have been authorized in writing at the Hanguranketha Divisional Secretariat Office at 1.00 p.m. on the day of 21.08. 2019. Further, they must communicate to me in duplicate the nature of their title / ownership to this land, the details of claiming for compensation for this land, the amount claimed, and the method of calculating such amount , before 14.08.2019. The deeds for claims have to be forwarded to at the interview. I.M. SENANAYAKA, Divisional Secretary, Hanguranketha. At the office of the Divisional Secretary, Hanguranketha. 15th July 2019 08-202\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30542 - 39 (2019/07) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk"
